  ],
  "duration_s": 91.553991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "不喝就是看不起我。领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病。小李，今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸。以后还有很多地方向您请教。不是年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。领导，您看鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。来，这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。领导，饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了。小李，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，我先敬您。小李啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？哈哈哈哈哈怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。哈哈哈哈关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1930,
      "text": "不喝就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2290,
      "end_ms": 2770,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3050,
      "end_ms": 4130,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4550,
      "end_ms": 5695,
      "text": "我是看不起病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8200,
      "end_ms": 8580,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9080,
      "end_ms": 10140,
      "text": "今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10500,
      "end_ms": 10900,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11140,
      "end_ms": 12720,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12720,
      "end_ms": 13460,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13880,
      "end_ms": 15540,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00011",
      "start_ms": 15540,
      "end_ms": 19790,
      "text": "不是年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00012",
      "start_ms": 20190,
      "end_ms": 21690,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22030,
      "end_ms": 23170,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23370,
      "end_ms": 24855,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00015",
      "start_ms": 27670,
      "end_ms": 28990,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00016",
      "start_ms": 29310,
      "end_ms": 30110,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30990,
      "end_ms": 31430,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31430,
      "end_ms": 36510,
      "text": "才守得住秘密鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00019",
      "start_ms": 36890,
      "end_ms": 38010,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00020",
      "start_ms": 38330,
      "end_ms": 38670,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00021",
      "start_ms": 38670,
      "end_ms": 40390,
      "text": "您看鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40530,
      "end_ms": 43130,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00023",
      "start_ms": 45230,
      "end_ms": 45410,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45410,
      "end_ms": 47190,
      "text": "这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47510,
      "end_ms": 47910,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00026",
      "start_ms": 48150,
      "end_ms": 49250,
      "text": "饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00027",
      "start_ms": 49430,
      "end_ms": 51450,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00028",
      "start_ms": 51450,
      "end_ms": 53095,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00029",
      "start_ms": 55340,
      "end_ms": 55720,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56040,
      "end_ms": 57500,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57960,
      "end_ms": 59540,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59540,
      "end_ms": 61720,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00033",
      "start_ms": 61720,
      "end_ms": 62405,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00034",
      "start_ms": 65790,
      "end_ms": 66495,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00035",
      "start_ms": 66860,
      "end_ms": 68380,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00036",
      "start_ms": 68380,
      "end_ms": 69405,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00037",
      "start_ms": 69910,
      "end_ms": 73755,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74270,
      "end_ms": 76865,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00039",
      "start_ms": 77370,
      "end_ms": 78845,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00040",
      "start_ms": 79420,
      "end_ms": 80380,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00041",
      "start_ms": 80520,
      "end_ms": 81960,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00042",
      "start_ms": 82100,
      "end_ms": 84125,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00043",
      "start_ms": 84490,
      "end_ms": 86325,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00044",
      "start_ms": 86610,
      "end_ms": 88190,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00045",
      "start_ms": 88250,
      "end_ms": 89125,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6b4b6362c573a87a_s00046",
      "start_ms": 89460,
      "end_ms": 91315,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
